{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 1, "ref": "jeremiah 3:1", "book": "jeremiah", "lang": "ms", "chapter": 3, "translation": "sambil berkata: Lihatlah, jika seorang lelaki membebaskan ⟨את⟩ isterinya dan ia pergi ⟨את⟩ dari padanya lalu menjadi milik seorang lelaki lain — masakkah ia kembali kepadanya lagi? Bukankah tanah itu menjadi cemar sepenuhnya? Tetapi engkau telah berzina dengan kekasih-kekasih yang banyak; namun kembalilah kepada-Ku, demikianlah titah Yahweh.", "tokens": [{"surface": "לאמר", "gloss": "sambil berkata"}, {"surface": "הן", "gloss": "lihatlah"}, {"surface": "ישלח", "gloss": "membebaskan"}, {"surface": "איש", "gloss": "seorang lelaki"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "isterinya"}, {"surface": "אשתו", "gloss": "isterinya"}, {"surface": "והלכה", "gloss": "dan ia pergi"}, {"surface": "מאתו", "gloss": "dari padanya ⟨את⟩"}, {"surface": "והיתה", "gloss": "dan menjadi"}, {"surface": "לאיש", "gloss": "bagi seorang lelaki"}, {"surface": "אחר", "gloss": "lain"}, {"surface": "הישוב", "gloss": "masakkah ia kembali"}, {"surface": "אליה", "gloss": "kepadanya"}, {"surface": "עוד", "gloss": "lagi"}, {"surface": "הלוא", "gloss": "bukankah"}, {"surface": "חנוף", "gloss": "cemar"}, {"surface": "תחנף", "gloss": "dipenuhi pencemaran"}, {"surface": "הארץ", "gloss": "tanah"}, {"surface": "ההיא", "gloss": "itu"}, {"surface": "ואת", "gloss": "tetapi engkau"}, {"surface": "זנית", "gloss": "engkau berzina"}, {"surface": "רעים", "gloss": "kekasih-kekasih"}, {"surface": "רבים", "gloss": "banyak"}, {"surface": "ושוב", "gloss": "kembalilah"}, {"surface": "אלי", "gloss": "kepada-Ku"}, {"surface": "נאם", "gloss": "titah"}, {"surface": "יהוה", "gloss": "Yahweh"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-04T13:10:35.050090771Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}